{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cfsx6pZLVeYavo7F3ra5Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good, this changes several things. Updated plan:\n\n## Audience & tone\nBuilt for prospective apprentices, food writers, and workshop bookers — not recruiters. No \"hire me\" framing; CTAs point to **apply for apprenticeship**, **book a workshop**, **press/media contact**. No supplier pricing anywhere. No staff faces unless Ines has their consent — default to none shown.\n\n## Corrected content\n\n- **Timeline**: Head Chef dated September 2022 (title), with acting-head-chef from March 2022 noted as the real start of her running the kitchen — not blurred together. Fjaerland shown honestly as a 10-week unpaid stage: washing and labelling jars, two batches of garum — not framed as research or a lab role.\n- **Waste stat**: \"We cut prep and plate waste from 14kg to 5kg a week\" — first-person plural, scoped to prep/plate only (bones excluded, they go to stock), measured over one month in 2023. Copy will say this plainly rather than implying an ongoing/precise metric.\n- **Image rights**:\n  - Priya Nair's restaurant photos → usable, with visible credit to her.\n  - Olu's Brine drawings → held back until Ines confirms with him; site built with a placeholder/\"coming soon\" for the zine section until cleared.\n  - Ines's own phone photos (larder, labels) and the grandmother's ogiri pot photo → usable now, no clearance needed.\n\n## Larder section, redesigned\nInstead of invented tasting notes on a jar shelf, this should be built around what she actually runs the kitchen on: the **ferment log** — date started, salt %, check-in days, ready date. That's real, specific, and more interesting than decorative flavor copy. The interactive piece becomes a scroll/hover view of log entries aging in real time, not a flavor-notes gallery.\n\n## Still needed before building\n- A handful of real ferment-log entries (even 5–6) to populate that section honestly.\n- Confirmation once Olu clears use of his drawings (or we launch without Brine's visuals, text-only, for now).\n- Contact/booking mechanism — email, form, or external booking link — for workshops and apprentice applications.\n- Any of Priya's/her own photos, once you're able to share image files.\n\nLet me know if this direction and the apprentice/writer/workshop framing feels right, and send over what you can on the open items — then I'll move to building."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1540,"cache_read_input_tokens":20304,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1540},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2d15a00-3735-4dcc-b3b9-bc51cda185ae","uuid":"9f545251-1935-4161-99b6-81b18a2b2326","timestamp":"2026-10-10T04:48:05.499Z","request_id":"req_011Cfsx6pMRzhadENghnzBQ3"}
